# {Brand}

Use the `{brand}` MCP server for {Brand} work. Discover the live tool list
before the first call; use tool names exactly as registered.

- Read before you write: look the target up by ID with a read-only tool.
- Confirm with the user before any tool marked destructive, and before
  sending anything outward.
- Deletes go to trash; say so, and offer restore.
- Never print, store, or ask for credentials in chat. They are configured in
  the plugin settings.
